      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please name functions like this `pe_*`. If you make it exported (see below), name it `pd_*`.\n\nThis one should probably be something like `pe_compose_svdm_header` or `pd_compose_svdm_header`. (Since the result will always be a structured VDM.)",
      "revId": "cbe321c1502d127cb9060bbdb9bb8979bef15d08",
